#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0193 expect=violation domain=MB
#note "Authority: SDTM and SDTMIG Conformance Rules v2.0 CG0193 (Condition: MBTESTCD = 'ORGANISM' and MBSTRESC ^= 'NO GROWTH' and MBMETHOD ^= 'GRAM STAIN'; Rule: MBRESCAT ^= null). Row 1 identifies STAPHYLOCOCCUS AUREUS by CULTURE with MBRESCAT null -> fires. Row 2 identifies an organism with MBRESCAT populated -> silent. Row 3 is NO GROWTH and row 4 is a GRAM STAIN, both excluded by the Condition although MBRESCAT is null -> silent."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-2
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt row=1 USUBJID=01-701-1015 MBSEQ=1 MBSTRESC="STAPHYLOCOCCUS AUREUS"
dataset MB class=FINDINGS label="Microbiology Specimen"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID  type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col MBSEQ    type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col MBTESTCD type=Char label="Microbiology Test or Finding Short Name"
col MBTEST   type=Char label="Microbiology Test or Finding Name"
col MBORRES  type=Char label="Result or Finding in Original Units"
col MBSTRESC type=Char label="Character Result/Finding in Std Format"
col MBRESCAT type=Char label="Result Category"
col MBMETHOD type=Char label="Method of Test or Examination"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | MB | 01-701-1015 | 1 | ORGANISM | Organism Present | STAPHYLOCOCCUS AUREUS | STAPHYLOCOCCUS AUREUS |  | CULTURE
CDISCPILOT01 | MB | 01-701-1015 | 2 | ORGANISM | Organism Present | ESCHERICHIA COLI | ESCHERICHIA COLI | INFECTING | CULTURE
CDISCPILOT01 | MB | 01-701-1023 | 1 | ORGANISM | Organism Present | NO GROWTH | NO GROWTH |  | CULTURE
CDISCPILOT01 | MB | 01-701-1023 | 2 | ORGANISM | Organism Present | GRAM POSITIVE COCCI | GRAM POSITIVE COCCI |  | GRAM STAIN
---
